ඊළඟට අපි **Buttons & CTAs** (බටන්ස් සහ ඇක්ෂන් මූලද්‍රව්‍ය) කාණ්ඩයෙන් පටන් ගමු. මෙහිදීත් මීට පෙර වගේම මෝස්තර 6 ටම (Cyberpunk, Neo-Brutalism, Glassmorphism, Bento Grid, Claymorphism, Retro Terminal) අදාළව **ස්ටייל එකකට කම්පොනන්ට්ස් 2 බැගින් සම්පූර්ණ 12 ක්** අන්තර්ක්‍රියාකාරී (Interactive) විදිහට හදමු.

මෙම කම්පොනන්ට්ස් ටික **`src/library/free/buttons/`** ෆෝල්ඩරය යටතේ සේව් කරගන්න.

### 1. කම්පොනන්ට්ස් ටික (Components)

**1. Cyberpunk Neon Glow Button (`CyberNeonButton.jsx`)**

```javascript
import { motion } from "framer-motion";

export default function CyberNeonButton() {
  return (
    <motion.button
      whileHover={{ scale: 1.05, boxShadow: "0 0 20px rgba(34,211,238,0.6)" }}
      whileTap={{ scale: 0.95 }}
      className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-slate-950 border border-cyan-400 text-cyan-400 font-baloo text-xs font-bold rounded-xl tracking-wider uppercase shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(34,211,238,0.3)] cursor-pointer"
    >
      EXECUTE_PROTOCOL
    </motion.button>
  );
}

```

**2. Cyberpunk Glitch Action Button (`CyberGlitchButton.jsx`)**

```javascript
import { motion } from "framer-motion";

export default function CyberGlitchButton() {
  return (
    <motion.button
      whileHover={{ x: [-2, 2, -2, 0], backgroundColor: "#22d3ee", color: "#020617" }}
      transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}
      className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-slate-900 border-2 border-cyan-500 text-cyan-300 font-baloo text-xs font-black rounded-xl tracking-widest uppercase cursor-pointer"
    >
      SYS_OVERRIDE
    </motion.button>
  );
}

```

**3. Neo-Brutalism Pop Button (`BrutalPopButton.jsx`)**

```javascript
import { motion } from "framer-motion";

export default function BrutalPopButton() {
  return (
    <motion.button
      whileHover={{ x: -2, y: -2, boxShadow: "6px 6px 0px 0px #020617" }}
      whileTap={{ x: 2, y: 2, boxShadow: "2px 2px 0px 0px #020617" }}
      className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-yellow-300 border-2 border-slate-950 text-slate-950 font-baloo text-xs font-black rounded-xl shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#020617] uppercase cursor-pointer"
    >
      BRUTAL_CLICK
    </motion.button>
  );
}

```

**4. Neo-Brutalism Action Pill (`BrutalActionPill.jsx`)**

```javascript
import { motion } from "framer-motion";

export default function BrutalActionPill() {
  return (
    <motion.button
      whileHover={{ y: -3, boxShadow: "5px 5px 0px 0px #020617" }}
      className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-pink-500 border-2 border-slate-950 text-white font-baloo text-xs font-black rounded-full shadow-[3px_3px_0px_0px_#020617] uppercase cursor-pointer"
    >
      DEPLOY_NODE
    </motion.button>
  );
}

```

